AI Worker - the plugin for Claude Code on staff computers.\par
\par
This installs the AI Worker plugin for you only (no admin rights). When it is done, a window finishes the setup: it checks that Claude is signed in, asks your full name, and registers the plugin with Claude Code. You can run that window again from the Start menu: Finish AI Worker setup.\par
\par
A company installer sends usage numbers (sessions, tokens, cost) to your company's AI Worker board. It never sends chat content, prompts, file names or project names.\par
\par
Install this file only if you got it from the person who runs your AI Worker board. Do not open an AI Worker installer that came by email, chat or USB from someone you do not know, even if the name looks right.\par
\par
To remove it: Settings > Apps > AI Worker plugin.\par
\par
\par
